# prompt: fast air whoosh, sword swing
# tags: whoosh, swing, air, fast
# A swing is a band-pass moving, not a level moving: the blade brings its own
# resonance up past the ear and away again, which is why the filter sweeps up
# and back down while the envelope only opens once.
sound "fast whoosh" 240ms
  air: noise white >> bp ~1400Hz[600..3200] -> ~5200Hz[2000..9000] in 80ms -> 900Hz in 90ms Q1.6 | gain 0.42 attack 35ms hold 20ms decay 150ms
  edge: noise pink >> hp ~3000Hz[1200..7000] | gain 0.18 attack 50ms decay 120ms
